Napakalaking donasyon
ang ginawa mo .

52:10.289 --> 52:11.320
Okay. Oo, sigurado.
Oo. Hey, hey.

52:11.489 --> 52:13.593
Okay, mahusay.
Ay, Leigh. Hoy, Leigh.

52:13.762 --> 52:15.093
Leigh. Hoy, Leigh.

